{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the Demo</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> \u2022 Join Red vs Blue teams, solo against bots, co-op, or in teams with your friends</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 One Battle as Guard delivering a package\u2026 one Battle as Thief trying to stop the delivery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Control Soda Pop Steve and Bongo Banana in wild, explosive Battles </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Explore the full city map, from your characters\u2019 restaurants to the GoatFish office</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Hear your characters\u2019 salty, hilarious comments as they slice, squish, and blast their opponents</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Listen as Chef Master chimes in with spicy commentary throughout the chaos</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Demo vs Full Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Demo has just 2 characters and their home locations, for a taste of the chaos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Full game has all 19 characters and all their home locations</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Full game includes Steam Achievements</strong> \u2013 unlock glory as you play</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>\u2022 Full game features global Steam Leaderboards</strong> \u2013 climb the ranks and dominate the kitchen arena</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 A Full game match consists of multiple Battles, with the winning team revealed at the end \u2013 Chef Master knows, but he\u2019s not telling!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2022 Settings are limited in the demo \u2013 full customization is available in\u00a0the\u00a0full\u00a0game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try the demo for free now! Love the madness? Add the full game to your wishlist and join th